When the user asks to **teardown**, reverse-engineer, or learn **implementable patterns** from
an external product/repo/site — load `product-teardown`.

Unit of work = **transferable pattern**, not feature checklist. ADOPT requires destination-side
evidence that the problem exists.

Run `scripts/validate_pattern_ledger.py` when pattern JSON exists. Not for competitor watchlists
(`competitive-intelligence`) or own-repo roadmap (`repo-to-roadmap`).
